      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town\u2019s name honors those settlers\u2019 Vermont hometown, linking Middlebury, Indiana, to Middlebury, Vermont.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
