      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middlebury%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1841, Amish families from Pennsylvania arrived, establishing the area as part of Northern Indiana\u2019s Amish country.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
